		{
			description: [
				"Beware the Sunken City, as it is said to be home of the Leviathan, a dangerous monster that has claimed the lives of many adventurers who were unprepared."
				""
				"Will you emerge victorious, or will the jaws of the Leviathan prove to be too powerful? Only one way to find out."
				""
				"The Sunken City is located in the Oceans of the Abyssal Chasm. You must brave the vast seas and slay The Leviathan if you wish to progress further."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/sunken_city_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
			]
