		{
			dependencies: ["381A81F03F347383"]
			description: [
				"The Leviathan has claimed many lives. You must be the one to end its cruel reign over the Deeplings."
				""
				"Beware... The Leviathan has attacks that can shake you to your core, rendering you unable to move. Consider bringing ender pearls to escape the grasp of The Leviathan. They can also be used to avoid its deadly lazer and tentacle attacks."
				""
				"Defeating The Leviathan will award you with the &5Tidal Claws&r - a powerful weapon that doubles as a grappling hook."
				""
				"The Leviathan will also drop its Abyssal Egg, which is used in making the Tier 6 rocket."
			]
