		{
			dependencies: ["4E26DD51B9FBDAC7"]
			description: [
				"Amethyst Crabs can be found in the Altar room, alongside the Deepling Priests. They drop Amethyst Crab Meat, which can greatly assist you in your fight against the Leviathan. "
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/amethyst_crab.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"Learn more on the next page."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You can bless the Amethyst Crab Meat using the Altar of Amethyst. Simply right click the Altar with Amethyst Crab Meat in your hand."
				""
				"Eating the Blessed Amethyst Crab Meat will give you the buff \"&5Blessing of Amethyst&r,\" which negates all 3 debuffs the Leviathan inflicts while you are battling it."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/blessed_crab_meat.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
