		{
			dependencies: ["285453E58AFF48B7"]
			description: [
				"The Ruined Citadel is littered with treasure, its halls lined with forgotten riches. There are loot chests filled with gear and even solid blocks of diamond and gold just waiting to be claimed."
				""
				"But such wealth is never left unguarded. As you plunder the Citadel, beware the Ender Golems, ever watchful and ready to strike you down."
				""
				"Once you've looted to your heart's content, click the checkmark to proceed."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ruined_citadel_loot.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
